%description:

Antenna-pattern attenuation of the three path-loss models, checked against
the antenna radiation pattern of 3GPP TR 36.814 v9.2.0 Table A.2.1.1-2 and
TR 36.873 v12.7.0 Table 7.1-1.

TR 36.814 has a horizontal pattern only, with a 70 degree half-power
beamwidth and a 25 dB front-to-back ratio. TR 36.873 adds a vertical pattern,
uses a 65 degree half-power beamwidth in both planes, and caps the horizontal
term, the vertical term and their sum at 30 dB each. Tr38901PathLossModel
inherits the TR 36.873 pattern unchanged.

The attenuation is returned as a positive number of dB to subtract.

Each case names the formula of pathloss_reference.py it is to be graded
against; the formulas themselves are quoted there.

%includes:
#include "PathLossTestUtil.h"
#include "simu5g/stack/phy/channelmodel/Tr36814PathLossModel.h"
#include "simu5g/stack/phy/channelmodel/Tr36873PathLossModel.h"
#include "simu5g/stack/phy/channelmodel/Tr38901PathLossModel.h"

%global:
using namespace simu5g;
using namespace simu5g::unittest;

%activity:
CaseRecorder probe(this, 1e-6);

// --- TR 36.814 -----------------------------------------------------------
// The vertical angle is not part of the TR 36.814 pattern and is ignored.
Tr36814PathLossModel m814;

probe.angularAttenuation("t814_antenna", m814, 0, 0);
probe.angularAttenuation("t814_antenna", m814, 35, 0);
probe.angularAttenuation("t814_antenna", m814, 70, 0);
probe.angularAttenuation("t814_antenna", m814, -70, 0);
probe.angularAttenuation("t814_antenna", m814, 120, 0);    // capped at 25
probe.angularAttenuation("t814_antenna", m814, 35, 155);   // ignores the vertical angle

// --- TR 36.873 -------------------------------------------------------------
Tr36873PathLossModel m873;

probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 0, 90);      // boresight
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 32.5, 90);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 65, 90);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, -65, 90);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 0, 155);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 0, 25);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 65, 155);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 90, 90);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 100, 155);   // sum capped at 30
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 300, 90);    // A_H capped at 30
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m873, 0, 250);     // A_V capped at 30

// --- TR 38.901 inherits the TR 36.873 pattern --------------------------
Tr38901PathLossModel m901;

probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m901, 0, 90);      // boresight
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m901, 65, 90);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m901, 65, 155);
probe.angularAttenuation("t873_antenna", m901, 100, 155);   // sum capped at 30

%postrun-command: ../../pathloss_reference.py --grade test.out >verdict.txt

%contains: verdict.txt
graded=21 failures=0

%not-contains: verdict.txt
FAILED

%not-contains: stdout
FAILED
